> A calculation before fitting

For three uniform frames over symbol0,symbol1,blank2 and target[0], exactly six of27 paths collapse to the target. The path0,blank,0 yields two labels and is excluded. CTC loss is-log(6/27)=log(4.5), not three independent token losses.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/ctc_handwriting_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){namespace n=dm::nn;double computed=n::ctc_loss(n::zeros({3,1,3}),n::zeros({1,1},n::DType::Int32),n::ones({1},n::DType::Int32),n::full({1},3,n::DType::Int32)).item(),analytic=std::log(4.5);if(std::abs(computed-analytic)>2e-6)throw std::runtime_error("hand calculation differs from native primitives");std::print("| native calculation | analytic reference |\n|---:|---:|\n| {:.9f} | {:.9f} |\n",computed,analytic);dm::graphics::RPlot::create().bars(std::vector<double>{0,1},std::vector<double>{computed,analytic},"worked reference",{37,99,235}).ylim(0,std::max(.5,std::max(computed,analytic)*1.2)).x_label("0 = native calculation;1 = analytic reference").y_label("Toy objective or diagnostic value").title("ctc handwriting hand calculation").size(1000,550).save_svg("build/ctc_handwriting_worked.svg");}
